<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's Feb iron, steel, import prices mixed.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's Feb iron, steel, import prices mixed.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's iron and steel import prices were mixed in February, the Association of Foreign Trading Agents of Korea (AFTAK) said on Monday.</p>
<p>Import prices of iron and steel were as follows:</p>
<p>(US$ a tonne C&amp;F)</p>
<p> COMMODITY		 Origin     Feb	 Jan</p>
<p> Pig iron		  China	171	 166</p>
<p> Scrap iron		U.S.	 147	 154</p>
<p> Billet		    Japan	260	 260</p>
<p> Hot coil		  Japan	330	 330</p>
<p> Slab			Brazil     258	 258</p>
<p> Stainless hot coil    Japan    1,560     1,560</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
</text>
